sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User (iPhone)
  participant P as Photon line
  participant L as EventLoop
  participant R as MessageRouter
  participant S as SessionStore
  participant M as MediaStore
  participant H as PhaseHandler
  U->>P: iMessage with photo
  P-->>L: message event (id, sender, attachmentId)
  L->>L: dedupe by event id
  L->>R: route(msg)
  R->>S: getOrCreate(sender)
  S-->>R: session (phase)
  R->>P: sendMessage("Got it — looking at your photo…")
  P-->>U: acknowledgement (under 2 s)
  loop until ready (max 5)
    R->>P: downloadAttachment(id)
    alt 409 ATTACHMENT_NOT_READY
      P-->>R: Retry-After 5s
    else 200
      P-->>R: image bytes
    end
  end
  R->>M: save(sessionId, bytes)
  R->>H: handle(msg, session)
  H-->>R: Reply[] (text + overlay image)
  R->>S: save(session)
  R->>P: send replies (idempotency keys)
  P-->>U: overlay + question
